Code of Conduct

Our Pledge

We pledge to make participation in our project a friendly, respectful, and welcoming experience for everyone.

Our Standards

Examples of positive behavior include:

- Being respectful and polite.
- Accepting constructive feedback.
- Respecting different opinions.
- Helping other contributors.

Unacceptable behavior includes harassment, insulting comments, discrimination, and disrespectful conduct.

Enforcement Responsibilities

Project maintainers are responsible for clarifying and enforcing our standards and taking appropriate action when necessary.

Scope

This Code of Conduct applies to all project spaces and public interactions related to the project.

Enforcement Guidelines

Project maintainers may take appropriate action depending on the severity of the violation, including warnings, temporary restrictions, or permanent removal from the project.

Attribution

This Code of Conduct is inspired by the Contributor Covenant.
